FFmpeg master 26bf8651a8d8 (2026-10-10), not in release/9.0 after 9.0.2:
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/26bf8651a8d88f722598c90f6afe7067e9a296dd

EXIF: the number of parsed IFD entries is bounded by the 12-byte records the
buffer can hold; nested IFDs that point at the same entries made the parse grow
exponentially (a JPEG of a few kB: a timeout). Part of the fix of
CVE-2026-125180 with fix-exif-3.

